on my front lawn.

00:04:06.234 --> 00:04:07.868
[ Laughter ]

00:04:07.868 --> 00:04:11.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:11.501 --> 00:04:12.834
Yeah, I'm dating again,
you know.

00:04:12.834 --> 00:04:15.701
But you know, me,
I'm messing with the migrants.

00:04:15.701 --> 00:04:17.000
That's my thing.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:18.601
I mess with migrants
'cause it ain't about money.

00:04:18.601 --> 00:04:19.734
It's about the green card.

00:04:19.734 --> 00:04:21.000
-Oh, interesting.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:22.133
-You don't even
got to have a rap.

00:04:22.133 --> 00:04:23.868
Or you got to do
is walk up to them and say,

00:04:23.868 --> 00:04:26.467
"You want to stay here?"
-Wow.

00:04:26.467 --> 00:04:28.067
-"America's nice, right?

00:04:28.067 --> 00:04:30.334
Yeah. Bring your scooter."

00:04:30.334 --> 00:04:32.734
But she got -- But she got
to have a dark tooth.

00:04:32.734 --> 00:04:34.701
-A dark tooth?
-I look dark tooth.

00:04:34.701 --> 00:04:37.067
That's my style.
-Just...Just the --

00:04:37.067 --> 00:04:38.634
-One dark tooth.
-One dark tooth.

00:04:38.634 --> 00:04:40.701
Okay.
So, that's interesting.

00:04:40.701 --> 00:04:43.367
[ Laughter ]

00:04:43.367 --> 00:04:46.334
