00:04:51.501 --> 00:04:52.467
-Yeah, but I can see
through that.

00:04:52.467 --> 00:04:54.567
-Yeah, you can
see through that.

00:04:54.567 --> 00:04:58.901
You -- I've heard you mention
there was that very...

00:04:58.901 --> 00:05:02.601
