-Oh, yeah.

00:05:02.601 --> 00:05:04.968
-It was -- Was it --
It was a riverboat.

00:05:04.968 --> 00:05:07.667
-Yeah. I started it.
-You did?

00:05:07.667 --> 00:05:09.267
-You talking about
the brawl in Alabama?

00:05:09.267 --> 00:05:10.534
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.
The riverboat.

00:05:10.534 --> 00:05:13.300
-I started that. I started that.
-You started that?

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:15.300
