00:05:32.767 --> 00:05:33.968
-[ Laughs ] No!

00:05:33.968 --> 00:05:34.934
So, let me get this straight.

00:05:34.934 --> 00:05:36.734
You go off to get
a fish sandwich.

00:05:36.734 --> 00:05:38.968
-Sammich!
-Okay. Sorry.

00:05:38.968 --> 00:05:40.634
